  <bpmn:collaboration id="L4_07_COLLAB" name="Finalise iPDs for clinical study report">
    <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Model: L4-07
Title: Finalise iPDs for clinical study report
Parent: L3 A7
Interface: start S1; ends E1; message flows M1
Open item: [verify interface] Neighbouring process 'CSR authoring' writes the sections on changes in conduct (E3 9.8) and patient disposition (E3 10.1); only the deviation content and the disposition label (REQ-178) belong to this step. Interface REQs: REQ-241, REQ-242.</bpmn:documentation>
