    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="L4_07_A2" name="Conduct blind review of deviations">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E9 S5.2 (p. printed 22); E9 S5.2.1 (p. printed 23); E9 GL:Blind Review (p. printed 32); E9 S5.2.2 (p. printed 24)
Requirements: REQ-156, REQ-162, REQ-163
