Jurisdiction: ICH
Deadline: before breaking the blind
Verify: [verify binding] EU/US adoption of E9 not checked by the research stems (C-06); [verify] sentence content from a single fetch (F19) (R2-085); [verify] glossary wording from a single fetch (F20) (R2-096); [verify] sentence content from a single fetch (F20) (R2-089)</bpmn:documentation>
