      <bpmn:outgoing>L4_07_F3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="L4_07_A3" name="Determine analysis sets">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E6R3 A1-4.2.6(c) (p. printed 48 / PDF 56); E9 S5.2.2 (p. printed 23-24 [verify]); E9 S5.2.1 (p. printed 22-23; printed 23); E9 S7.1 (p. printed 30); TCB-PD-TIRS SReview-and-Analyze (p. journal pp. 733-742 (section page not confirmed; PMC HTML read))
Requirements: REQ-159, REQ-157, REQ-158, REQ-164
Binding: binding-ICH
Jurisdiction: ICH
Deadline: before breaking the blind
Record: analysis set decisions; documented per protocol exclusion reasons; exclusion reasons
Party: responsible party
Verify: [verify binding] EU/US adoption of E9 not checked by the research stems (C-06); [verify] printed page: 23 per F19, 24 per F21 (R2-087); [verify] printed page: 23 per F19, 24 per F21 (R2-086); [verify] sentence content from a single fetch (F19) (R2-084)</bpmn:documentation>
