    <bpmn:callActivity id="L4_07_A4" name="Handle statistical analysis and estimands">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E9 S5.2.3 (p. printed 24 [verify]); E9R1 SA.3.1 (p. printed 6); E9R1 SA.4 (p. printed 13; printed 14); E9R1 SA.6 (p. printed 19)
Requirements: REQ-237, REQ-239, REQ-240
Binding: binding-ICH
Jurisdiction: ICH
